LNG 307 International E-mailing 1(1-0-2)
(การเขียนอีเมลเพื่อการสื่อสารสากล)
Pre-requisite LNG 220 Academic English หรือ LNG 222 Academic Listening and Speaking in International Contexts หรือ LNG 321 Academic Reading and Writing in International Contexts The course aims to equip students with the knowledge of the form and register of emailing. This includes email etiquette and awareness of cultural differences when using email to contact others in an international setting.
