(การเรียนภาษาอังกฤษผ่านการเรียนรู้ด้วยตนเอง)
Pre-requisite LNG 220 Academic English หรือ LNG 222 Academic Listening and Speaking in International Contexts หรือ LNG 321 Academic Reading and Writing in International Contexts Self-based learning theory. Self-based learning processes. Exposure to and use of English through a structured experience. Reporting and reflecting on the exposure to and use of English and receiving teacher's advice through the Internet.
